    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538510/extras/f8c0e0f8929ae86fa82bb0c67e0c82b9.poster.avif?t=1740700726\" width=320 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538510/extras/f8c0e0f8929ae86fa82bb0c67e0c82b9.webm?t=1740700726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538510/extras/f8c0e0f8929ae86fa82bb0c67e0c82b9.mp4?t=1740700726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538510/extras/ee37c17da26e76b0052db20c57abdb54.avif?t=1740700726\" width=688 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows the protagonist over the course of a life-changing summer. Engage in light-hearted moments, heartfelt conversations, and even some intimate scenes by interacting with the game through conversations, chores, and shared activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative unfolds through a series of daily routines revealing deeper emotional connections and desires, as well as unresolved conflicts and misunderstandings causing friction between the members. While the game primarily follows a linear narrative, your choices during key moments shape the tone of relationships and the dynamics between characters, allowing you to forge stronger bonds.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538510/extras/f8c0e0f8929ae86fa82bb0c67e0c82b9.poster.avif?t=1740700726\" width=320 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538510/extras/f8c0e0f8929ae86fa82bb0c67e0c82b9.webm?t=1740700726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538510/extras/f8c0e0f8929ae86fa82bb0c67e0c82b9.mp4?t=1740700726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538510/extras/ee37c17da26e76b0052db20c57abdb54.avif?t=1740700726\" width=688 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows the protagonist over the course of a life-changing summer. Engage in light-hearted moments, heartfelt conversations, and even some intimate scenes by interacting with the game through conversations, chores, and shared activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative unfolds through a series of daily routines revealing deeper emotional connections and desires, as well as unresolved conflicts and misunderstandings causing friction between the members. While the game primarily follows a linear narrative, your choices during key moments shape the tone of relationships and the dynamics between characters, allowing you to forge stronger bonds.\u00a0</p>",
